<title>PHILIPPINES: Rizal Bank sets dividend record date.</title>
<headline>Rizal Bank sets dividend record date.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rizal Commercial Banking Corp said on Friday the Philippine Central Bank had approved the record date of its 17.5 centavo cash dividend set for June 26.</p>
<p>The dividend amounting to 66.91 million pesos covering the first half of 1997 will be payable on July 24. The ex-date is June 17.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
